      en: ["Built in 1890.", "Located on Likoma Island, Lake Malawi.", "Named after Captain Maguire.", "Walls were 1 meter thick.", "Ruins cover 400 square meters.", "Declared national monument in 1995."],
      es: ["Construido en 1890.", "En la isla Likoma del lago Malaui.", "Nombrado en honor al capitán Maguire.", "Los muros tenían 1 metro de espesor.", "Las ruinas cubren 400 metros cuadrados.", "Declarado Monumento Nacional en 1995."],
